WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:04.671
This is how the marine language uses

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:07.757
sound and bubbles
rather than words to communicate.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.927
I'm Legom, a hen.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.805
Because we're seated alphabetically,

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.641
I'm sitting next to a dull male wolf.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:21.271
He always looks stumped
with drooping brows,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.649
so I call him a brow-knitter.

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:32.323
The brow-knitter and I are not that close,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.703
but I know one of his secrets.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:42.625
Class dismissed.
Review today's lesson thoroughly.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.009
You really like egg sandwiches.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.303
It tastes the best on Wednesday.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.555
No way. They're all the same.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:58.975
No, they're different.
I can't explain it, though.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.729
It's too good to be sold at school.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:07.484
Right? Of course it is.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:12.363
The egg sandwich he snacks on
every Wednesday,

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.993
those eggs are, in fact, laid by me.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.870
EGG SUPPLY ROSTER (LEGOM)

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:24.876
I sell my eggs to restaurants on campus
as a part-time job.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:30.924
I take great pride in this job.

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:33.009
Hey, Legom.

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:38.098
I'm having a movie night tonight.
Do you want to come?

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:40.850
Thanks for the invite, but I'll pass.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.104
Staying up too late would be
bad for my eggs.

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:48.566
What? It's just a part-time job,
take it easy.

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:50.193
You're wrong.

00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:55.532
Laying eggs is not a mere part-time job.

00:01:56.199 --> 00:02:00.912
I'm doing this for our dignity
and pride of all henkind.

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:03.540
Excuse me.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:07.335
I even started exercising, which is my
least favorite, for a mere part-time job.

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:10.713
Don't worry. I'm not upset.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.341
Legom.

00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:20.000
I'm not doing this to provide
carnivores with necessary protein.

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:23.226
It's for nobody else but me.

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:27.155
I'll keep laying high-quality eggs.

00:02:27.373 --> 00:02:32.569
That, for sure, is my beautiful life.

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:44.914
JUNE 16, WEDNESDAY

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.958
Hey, Legoshi.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:49.752
Today's Wednesday,
where's your egg sandwich?

00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:54.257
It tastes different these days.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:58.261
I told you, they're all the same.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.930
Maybe...

